// "ui_checkrestart" on zoo, as the options menu's Ok button runs it: latch r_picmip (a
// video latch) under options, check and pop on one line; the restart runs after the line.
// Retail's script does not go on after a restart, so its run ends at -Secs. probe-rsnd
// does the same with s_loadas8bit (a sound latch) under advancedoptions. Compare the logs
// from the ==== marker; then remove r_picmip and s_loadas8bit from both sandboxes'
// config.cfg.
probe:
waitforplayer
wait 2
stuffcmd "echo ==== check; pushmenu options; set r_picmip 1; ui_checkrestart; popmenu 0"
wait 5
stuffcmd "echo ==== after; r_picmip"
wait 1
stuffcmd "quit"
end
